  (text "COMPONENT SUMMARY\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nU1  - SN74LVCH16T245PWR      16-bit level translator\nU2  - AM26C31IDWR             Quad differential driver (axes 0-1)\nU3  - AM26C31IDWR             Quad differential driver (axes 2-3)\nU4  - AM26C31IDWR             Quad differential driver (axes 4-5)\nU5  - TLP2361(TP,E)           Opto-isolator for E-stop\nK1  - G7L-2A-BUBJ-CB          Safety relay (2-pole, 24V)\nU6  - LMR33630ADDA            Buck regulator (24V→5V, 3A)\n\nR1-R12   - CRCW060333R0FKEA  33Ω series damping (0603)\nR13-R18  - CRCW0603120RFKEA  120Ω termination (0603, DNP)\nR19      - CRCW08052K40FKEA  2.4kΩ current limit (0805)\n\nC1-C6    - GRM188R71C104KA01  0.1µF decoupling (0603)\nC7-C8    - GRM31CR71A106KA01  10µF bulk (1206)\n\nJ1-J7    - Phoenix 1803577    6-pin terminal (3.81mm)\nTP1-TP2  - Keystone 5003      Test loops\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nPCB: 4-layer, FR-4, 1.6mm, 2oz copper\nLayers 1/3: Controlled-impedance differential pairs (120Ω)\nLayers 2/4: Ground and power planes\n\nSee docs/hardware/servo_driver_interface.md for full details" 
